llustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":7,"title":"Fawn falling","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":8,"title":"Fawn crying","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":9,"title":"Monkey massaging fawn's legs","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":10,"title":"Bear picking fawn up","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":11,"title":"Mother and young fawn","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"},{"page":12,"title":"Mother and fawn laughing","illustrator":"Ajit Narayan","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2007"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-16"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಜಿಂಕೆ ಮರಿಯೊಂದು ಓಟ ಓಡುತ್ತಿತ್ತು."]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅವನು ಮೊಲಕ್ಕಿಂತಲೂ ಮುಂದೆ, ಮುಂದೆ ಸಾಗಿದ್ದನು."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಆನೆಗಿಂತಲೂ ಅವನು ಮುಂದಿದ್ದನು."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಹೊಳೆಯನ್ನೂ ಹಾರಿ, ಜಿಗಿದು ದಾಟಿ ಓಡಿದ."]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಪಾಳುಗೋಡೆಯನ್ನು ದಾಟಿ ಮುಂದೆ ಓಡಿದ."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅಲ್ಲಿ ಹುಲ್ಲುಗಾವಲಲ್ಲಿ ದೊಡ್ಡ ಬಂಡೆ ಇತ್ತು.","ಅವನು ಅದನ್ನು ಎಡವಿ, ಯರ್ರಾಬಿರ್ರಿ ಬಿದ್ದ."]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಗೊಳೋ ಎಂದು ಕಣ್ಣೀರು ಸುರಿಸಿದ."]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಕೋತಿಯೊಂದು ಅವನ ಕಾಲು ಒತ್ತಿ ನೀವಿತು. ಜಿಂಕೆಮರಿಯ ಕಂಗಳಿಂದ ಕಣ್ಣೀರ ಹೊಳೆಯೇ ಹರಿಯಿತು."]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಕರಡಿ ಅಣ್ಣ ಅವನನ್ನು ಎತ್ತಿಕೊಂಡನು.","ಮರಿಜಿಂಕೆಯ ಅಳುವು ಮಾತ್ರ ನಿಲ್ಲಲಿಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಅವನ ಅಮ್ಮ ಬಂದಳು, “ನೋಡು, ಈ ಭಂಡ ಬಂಡೆಯನು ನಾವು ಒಡೆದು ಹಾಕುವ!” ಎಂದಳು."]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"https://assets.sirigannada.in/picturebooks/14802-nasunage-beeri/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":381},"text":["ಜಿಂಕೆಮರಿಯು ಹೇಳಿತು, \"ಒಹ್, ಹಾಗೆ ಮಾಡದಿರು ಅಮ್ಮ. ಆಗ ಅವನು ಅಳತೊಡಗುವನು. ತಾಯಿ ಜಿಂಕೆ ನಕ್ಕಿತು. ಮರಿ ಜಿಂಕೆ ನಕ್ಕಿತು."]}],"wordCount":79}